# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR[[cite:obs-ecf2d73f2c1b5d62a972da0856bf20de6b791f94 "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]]. Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director[[cite:obs-0a8a75d9ee1e537845cf424aa28abff532fe54a4 "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
